title Vinyl at the other canvases (their own densities): now playing, browser, queue, output; 800x600 and 1024x768 take the two panes (640x480: qa-640)
sizes 720x720 1280x720 480x800 1024x600 800x600 1024x768
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot s-now
expect esc
key b
wait 300
shot s-browser
key q
wait 300
shot s-queue
key esc
wait 200
key o
wait 300
shot s-output
expect noquit
